  "ingredients": [
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1.5 cups vegetable oil",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "3 eggs",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "2 medium Granny Smith apples - peeled, cored and chopped",
    "1 cup chopped walnuts",
    "0.5 cup butter or margarine",
    "2 teaspoons milk",
    "0.5 cup brown sugar"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9-inch Bundt pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/X4z6IkmmsQX1qQQbtEoxETQLejw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-01-006fd52e9dbf49cdab3228cccc6357d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar, oil, vanilla, and eggs with an electric mixer in a large bowl until light and fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Sm7SRTMbDkw7g-hzd0x0vDWCxQA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-02-ff31230d43dc4996b885dcdcf41f10cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking soda, cinnamon, and salt; stir into batter just until blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AImtRVt50AjRSYzjuMxUGjUVNyQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-03-e7e8efae0eb4421c904bbc04f59aae04.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in apples and walnuts using a spoon. Pour into the prepared Bundt pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qK5QK1g4bZctpud-3gLug9E9JUE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-04-a23c3cdfb4be435ab29bf0b948bc6faf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of the cake comes out clean, about 1 hour to 1 hour 20 minutes. Allow cake to cool in pan for about 15 minutes then invert on to a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vJNdhtA7dKKR62jJto_j-5GEEJQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-05-1e2e3c2a264149649b829ffa59299f71.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the caramel glaze: Heat butter, milk, and brown sugar in a small saucepan over medium heat. Bring to a boil, stirring to dissolve sugar, then remove from the heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VeKN0FHAUuKSwAy7iTEKfJnaHnY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-06-4ae0a95bb68845498aac446df0588005.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle glaze over warm cake.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cuC6CzBFFw89RMCF2QEfW1r1IuM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/73751-apple-harvest-pound-cake-with-caramel-glaze-VAT-step-07-31914cdc753a4b439099db9710ef2149.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/73751/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
